- Do not put third-party skills in `vibeCodingRules/cursor/` — list them here only.
- If `npx` fails with npm cache `EACCES`, fix ownership of `~/.npm` or run with `NPM_CONFIG_CACHE=/tmp/npm-cache npx skills ...`.

