## Global MCP Servers (New Machine)

MCP config is machine-local (`~/.cursor/mcp.json`), not synced via project rules.

| Service | Setup | Auth |
|---------|-------|------|
| [21st.dev](https://21st.dev/mcp) | From `$HOME`: `npx @21st-dev/cli@latest init --client cursor --write` | `npx @21st-dev/cli@latest login` (browser), **or** export `API_KEY_21ST` in `~/.zshrc` (key from [21st.dev/mcp](https://21st.dev/mcp)) |
| [shadcn-ui-mcp](https://github.com/Jpisnice/shadcn-ui-mcp-server) | Merge into `~/.cursor/mcp.json` (see below) | Optional: export `GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN` in `~/.zshrc` (60 req/h without; 5000 with — [token guide](https://github.com/Jpisnice/shadcn-ui-mcp-server/blob/master/docs/getting-started/github-token.md)) |

**21st companion skills** (optional but recommended with MCP):

```bash
npx @21st-dev/cli@latest install-skill
```

Installs: `21st-cli-use`, `21st-ai`, `21st-registry`, `21st-design-sync` → `~/.cursor/skills/`

**Verify:** Restart Cursor → MCP panel shows `21st` connected. CLI: `npx @21st-dev/cli@latest whoami`

**shadcn-ui-mcp** block for `~/.cursor/mcp.json`:

```json
"shadcn-ui": {
  "command": "npx",
  "args": ["-y", "@jpisnice/shadcn-ui-mcp-server"],
  "env": {
    "GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN": "${GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN}"
  }
}
```

**Optional (official install MCP):** per React project with `components.json`, run `npx shadcn@latest mcp init --client cursor` — adds registry install tools to that repo's `.cursor/mcp.json`. Complements shadcn-ui-mcp (browse source) with CLI install.

