## Skill Priority Routing

Full matrix: `agent-skills-routing.md` (sync `cursor/agent-skills-routing.mdc` with `alwaysApply: true` to every project).

**Quick summary:**
- Global `-g` skills = available in all workspaces on this machine (descriptions auto; full skill on trigger).
- Rules + MCP = see layers in `agent-skills-routing.md`.
- Default primaries: `ui-ux-pro-max` (UI), official GSAP pack (animation API), 21st MCP (component install), `vercel-react-best-practices` (Next perf).
